ation, key/data, and end-to-end ingestion state.","limitations":["The lifecycle listening-socket snapshots were empty even though executor probes directly showed sshd listening, so those supplemental socket inventories do not independently corroborate service health.","Systemd service-state collection was unsupported on this legacy platform, and the lifecycle yum package-health probe invoked an unsupported command form; broad failed-service and package-consistency status therefore remain unassessed.","Temporary evidence and reboot log files were not removed after verification."]}
